{
  "id": "PSA.60",
  "number": "60",
  "bookId": "PSA",
  "reference": "Psalm 60",
  "copyright": "The Holy Bible, New International Version® NIV® Copyright © 1973, 1978, 1984, 2011 by Biblica, Inc.® Used by Permission of Biblica, Inc.® All rights reserved worldwide.",
  "verseCount": 12,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "60",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "PSA 60"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "60",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "cl"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Psalm 60",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "d"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "For the director of music. To the tune of \"The Lily of the Covenant.\" A",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "tl"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "miktam",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "of David. For teaching. When he fought Aram Naharaim",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "and Aram Zobah,",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "and when Joab returned and struck down twelve thousand Edomites in the Valley of Salt.",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 60:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "You have rejected us, God, and burst upon us;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.60.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.60.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "PSA 60:1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "you have been angry—now restore us!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.60.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.60.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 60:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "You have shaken the land and torn it open;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.60.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.60.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "PSA 60:2"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "mend its fractures, for it is quaking.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.60.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.60.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 60:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "You have shown your people desperate times;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.60.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.60.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "PSA 60:3"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "you have given us wine that makes us stagger.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.60.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.60.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 60:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But for those who fear you, you have raised a banner",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.60.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.60.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "PSA 60:4"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "to be unfurled against the bow.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.60.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.60.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "b"
      },
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 60:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Save us and help us with your right hand,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.60.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.60.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "PSA 60:5"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "that those you love may be delivered.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.60.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.60.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 60:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "God has spoken from his sanctuary:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.60.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.60.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "PSA 60:6"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "\"In triumph I will parcel out Shechem",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.60.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.60.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "PSA 60:6"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "and measure off the Valley of Sukkoth.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.60.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.60.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 60:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gilead is mine, and Manasseh is mine;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.60.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.60.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "PSA 60:7"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ephraim is my helmet,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.60.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.60.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "PSA 60:7"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Judah is my scepter.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.60.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.60.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 60:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Moab is my washbasin,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.60.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.60.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "PSA 60:8"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "on Edom I toss my sandal;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.60.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.60.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "PSA 60:8"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "over Philistia I shout in triumph.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.60.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.60.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "b"
      },
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 60:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Who will bring me to the fortified city?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.60.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.60.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "PSA 60:9"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Who will lead me to Edom?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.60.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.60.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 60:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Is it not you, God, you who have now rejected us",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.60.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.60.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "PSA 60:10"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "and no longer go out with our armies?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.60.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.60.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 60:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Give us aid against the enemy,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.60.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.60.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "PSA 60:11"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "for human help is worthless.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.60.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.60.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 60:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "With God we will gain the victory,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.60.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.60.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "PSA 60:12"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "and he will trample down our enemies.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.60.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.60.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "next": {
    "id": "PSA.61",
    "number": "61",
    "bookId": "PSA"
  },
  "previous": {
    "id": "PSA.59",
    "number": "59",
    "bookId": "PSA"
  }
